Package: ply
Type: Package
Title: Bitboard Chess Engine for R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Qusai", "Jouda", email = "qjouda@gmu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Qusai Jouda [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Qusai Jouda <qjouda@gmu.edu>
Description: A fully legal chess move generator and game engine
    implemented in C++17 via Rcpp. Provides FEN parsing, PGN replay,
    position feature enrichment, and a multi-game registry backed by
    a bitboard representation.
